name blochsphere
category Package
revision 38388
shortdesc Draw pseudo-3D diagrams of Bloch spheres
relocated 1
longdesc This package is used to draw pseudo-3D Blochsphere diagrams. It
longdesc supports various annotations, such as great and small circles,
longdesc axes, rotation markings and state vectors. It can be used in a
longdesc standalone fashion, or nested within a tikzpicture environment
longdesc by setting the environment option nested to true.
runfiles size=5
